## Verification

```bash
cd front-end
npm run type-check
npm run lint
```

Audit generic control ids (should trend to zero):

```bash
rg 'id="(name|email|address|phone|city|state|country|description|website|active)"' front-end/src --glob "*.tsx"
```

Manual DevTools checks:
1. Any authenticated route → `#app-layout-main-content`
2. Users list → `#users-page`, `#users-page-header`, `#users-page-body`
3. Tag dialog → `#tags-form-dialog`, `#tags-form-dialog-body`
